{"The server-rendered header (_header.html.erb) places .panel inside a Bootstrap .row, but the PR removes float: right and replaces it with flex-only positioning (margin-left: auto + order). Because .row is not a flex container, the login panel will no longer right-align and may drop below the title for logged-out pages.": 0.4045051634311676, "The new flexbox()/inline-flex() mixins emit display: -moz-box / display: -moz-inline-box, but align-items() does not emit -moz-box-align. This creates inconsistent cross-browser behavior: any case that falls back to the -moz box model won't get the intended alignment (e.g., badge bullet baseline alignment).": 0.880152702331543}